{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Winds of Valen \u2013 A Free Fantasy Sandbox MMORPG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Winds of Valen</strong> is a completely free-to-play fantasy MMORPG inspired by the golden age of old school MMOs like Old School RuneScape. Explore an open world with meaningful, non-linear progression, where every reward has purpose and every journey is unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-Linear Open World</strong><br>Step into a living world with no set path. Choose your own adventures, travel in any direction, and forge your legacy at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/a7705d03ed87908ed2d5db58de54839e.poster.avif?t=1761881334\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/a7705d03ed87908ed2d5db58de54839e.webm?t=1761881334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/a7705d03ed87908ed2d5db58de54839e.mp4?t=1761881334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-Based Progression</strong><br>Train and master your skills:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Skills</strong>: Attack, Defence, and Health</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Professions</strong>: Mining and Smithing, deeply tied into your equipment, upgrades, and overall progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/65ca6368ee79a5321f76ad84fc7e9ce3.poster.avif?t=1761881334\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/65ca6368ee79a5321f76ad84fc7e9ce3.webm?t=1761881334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/65ca6368ee79a5321f76ad84fc7e9ce3.mp4?t=1761881334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player-Driven Crafting &amp; Progression</strong><br>Gather resources, smelt ore, and forge powerful gear. Every tool and weapon has purpose\u2014there are no junk items, only future potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/532e969f64d9b57e8ce36d2f102efa31.poster.avif?t=1761881334\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/532e969f64d9b57e8ce36d2f102efa31.webm?t=1761881334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/532e969f64d9b57e8ce36d2f102efa31.mp4?t=1761881334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot &amp; Reward System</strong><br>Every monster in Winds of Valen drops its own rare, unique item.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare drop chances are displayed openly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you don\u2019t receive a rare item, the chances increase\u2014ensuring you\u2019re never stuck \u201cgoing dry\u201d.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every item is balanced, useful, and designed to have its place in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oldschool Sandbox Design</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression isn\u2019t forced or linear \u2014 explore the world, train skills, and advance however you choose. There\u2019s no set path to follow, only the one you make for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Winds of Valen</strong> is built for players who miss the feeling of true adventure\u2014where every item matters, every journey is unique, and every skill mastered feels earned.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4135880?t=1761881334","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4135880?t=1761881334","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/47aad247c9928286d4e3a177d1210618ce028985/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761881334","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/47aad247c9928286d4e3a177d1210618ce028985/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761881334","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Winds of Valen \u2013 A Free Fantasy Sandbox MMORPG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Winds of Valen</strong> is a completely free-to-play fantasy MMORPG inspired by the golden age of old school MMOs like Old School RuneScape. Explore an open world with meaningful, non-linear progression, where every reward has purpose and every journey is unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-Linear Open World</strong><br>Step into a living world with no set path. Choose your own adventures, travel in any direction, and forge your legacy at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"