otential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/532e969f64d9b57e8ce36d2f102efa31.poster.avif?t=1761881334\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/532e969f64d9b57e8ce36d2f102efa31.webm?t=1761881334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/532e969f64d9b57e8ce36d2f102efa31.mp4?t=1761881334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot &amp; Reward System</strong><br>Every monster in Winds of Valen drops its own rare, unique item.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare drop chances are displayed openly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you don\u2019t receive a rare item, the chances increase\u2014ensuring you\u2019re never stuck \u201cgoing dry\u201d.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every item is balanced, useful, and designed to have its place in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oldschool Sandbox Design</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression isn\u2019t forced or linear \u2014 explore the world, train skills, and advance however you choose. There\u2019s no set path to follow, only the one you make for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Winds of Valen</strong> is built for players who miss the feeling of true adventure\u2014where every item matters, every journey is unique, and every skill mastered feels earned.</p>","developers":["Head Coach Games"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Microsoft Playfab (Supports Linking to Steam Account)","genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"de